          "bodyContent": "=Hi {{ $json.contactToName }},<br><br>\n\nGreat speaking to you today. Here's the <a href=\"{{ $('Webhook').first().json.body[0].propertyValue }}\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: underline;\">engagement proposal</a> for you to review and sign and here's more details about <a href=\"https://view.genially.com/69451f406a056f5581511dc3/presentation-pricing-packages\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: underline;\">our services and prices</a>.<br><br>\n\nOnce the proposal is signed, we'll introduce you to the team who'll be working with you so you can arrange the kick off call.<br><br>\n\nLooking forward to working with you.<br><br>\n\nBest,<br><br>\n\n[YOUR-EMAIL-SIGNATURE-HTML]",
